    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have type 2 diabetes and i started taking this new herbal supplement called \"gluco-balance\" a couple days ago. since then im like crazy thirsty all the time and i feel like i have to pee every 20 mins. is this just a side effect of the supplement making me extra hydrated or something??",
